## Multi-model pair-programming agent

Run a local multi-model coding session (planner + coder + reviewer) against your Ollama instance:

```bash
python3 /home/runner/work/boilerplate-local-AI/boilerplate-local-AI/tools/multi_model_pair_programmer_agent.py \
  --repo-path /home/runner/work/boilerplate-local-AI/boilerplate-local-AI \
  --goal "Create a minimal REST API with tests" \
  --output /home/runner/work/boilerplate-local-AI/boilerplate-local-AI/multi-model-pair-programming-session.md
```

You can force models with `--planner-model`, `--coder-model`, and `--reviewer-model` if needed.
